          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "C’est le plus faible de tous les Pokémon Dragon. Sa peau doit rester hydratée pour respirer, c’est pourquoi il préfère vivre tapi dans l’ombre.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "The weakest of all Dragon-type Pokémon, it’s unable to breathe if its skin dries out, so it sticks to shady places.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "最も　弱い　ドラゴンポケモン。 皮膚が　乾くと　息が　できないので 日陰で　じーっと　しているよ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ヌメヌメの　ねんまくで　みを　まもる。 ねんまくは　ざっきんまみれ　なので さわったら　しっかり　てを　あらおう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Son corps est recouvert d’une membrane gluante protectrice, mais pleine de germes. Lavez-vous les mains si vous le touchez !",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its source of protection is its slimy, germ-laden mucous membrane. Anyone who touches it needs some thorough hand-washing.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ヌメヌメの　粘膜で　身を　守る。 粘膜は　雑菌まみれ　なので 触ったら　しっかり　手を　洗おう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ツノで　あたりの　ようすを　さぐる。 とても　びんかんなので　にぎられると ショックで　うごけなくなってしまう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ses cornes lui permettent d’inspecter les alentours. Elles sont si sensibles que tout son corps se fige si on les pince.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It uses its horns to check out its surroundings. They’re very sensitive, so if you grab them, it will feel a strong shock and be unable to move.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ツノで　あたりの　様子を　探る。 とても　敏感なので　握られると ショックで　動けなくなってしまう。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "からだの　ほとんどは　すいぶん。 かんそうすると　しんでしまうので いつも　ひかげで　じっと　している。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Son corps est majoritairement composé d’eau. Il meurt s’il se dessèche, aussi préfère-t-il vivre tapi dans l’ombre.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its body is mostly water. If it dries out, it will die, so it’s always sitting with perfect stillness in the shade.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "身体の　ほとんどは　水分。 乾燥すると　死んでしまうので いつも　日陰で　じっと　している。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "からだの　ほとんどが　すいぶん。 かんそうすると　ひからびてしまう さいじゃくの　ドラゴンポケモン。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Son corps est principalement composé d’eau. S’il se déshydrate, il devient tout rabougri. C’est le plus faible des Pokémon Dragon.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Because most of its body is water, it will dry up if the weather becomes too arid. It’s considered the weakest dragon Pokémon.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "体の　ほとんどが　水分。 乾燥すると　干からびてしまう 最弱の　ドラゴンポケモン。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ツノは　すぐれた　かんかくきかん。 てきの　けはいを　かんじとり　すぐに かくれる　ことで　いきのこってきた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ses cornes sont des organes sensoriels qui lui permettent de se cacher quand il détecte des ennemis. C’est grâce à cela qu’il vit toujours.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Their horns are powerful sensors. As soon as Goomy pick up any sign of enemies, they go into hiding. This is how they’ve survived.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ツノは　優れた　感覚器官。 敵の　気配を　感じ取り　すぐに 隠れる　ことで　生き残ってきた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Goomy hides away in the shade of trees, where it's nice and humid. If the slime coating its body dries out, the Pokémon instantly becomes lethargic.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "legends-arceus",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/39/"
        }
      }
